      "cooked": "<p>So, while doing reference for my sprites, i noticed something about La Capitan.&nbsp;</p><p>On her flipside it shows 4 forms. Her norma side, an alternate version with an orange bandana,an aquatic liek creature, and one with a gold robotic arm.</p><p>It's the last one I'm most interested in. Doesn't it look like Chrono Rangers promo gold arm? Could it be a link why she is Chrono-Rangers nemesis in VotM?</p><p><span>End of fan theory&nbsp;</span></p>",
